'''Level 1313 Boardwalk Cafe'''<ref name="Design Origin">{{SW|url=news/designing-star-wars-resistance|text=Designing ''Star Wars'': ''Star Wars Resistance''|author=[[Kristin Baver|Baver, Kristin]]|date=2019-03-11}}</ref> was a [[restaurant]] advertised on the chassis of [[R4-G77]],<ref name="Unmotivated">{{Resistance|Unmotivated}}</ref> an [[astromech droid]] owned by [[Hype Fazon]], a [[racer]] [[pilot]] on the ''[[Colossus]]'' [[Fuel|refueling]] [[Space station|station]]. The business logo was written in [[Aurebesh]].<ref name="Recruit">{{Resistance|The Recruit}}</ref> The cafe shared its name with [[Level 1313]], a level in the [[Coruscant Underworld]].<ref name="Lethal">{{TCW|Lethal Trackdown}}</ref>

